      50.64,
      394.39,
      286.45,
      461.09
    ],
    "text": "It is hereby given notice under sub-section (1) of section 7 of the Land Acquition Act, as (amended) by the Land Acquition (amended) Act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:-",
