      304.08,
      380.24,
      539.39,
      447.68
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretatiat, Dehiovita on the 18th day of March, 2015 at 10.30 a. m.",
