      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      450.06,
      539.35,
      558.56
    ],
    "text": "And further all are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 2nd day of March, 2015, the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land *Servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
