  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      306.08,
      294.87,
      396.8
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of the land in extent of about 3.6292 Hectares shown in Town Survey Preliminary Plan No. 14B Additional 45 Paper No. 52 prepared by the survey Superintendent, situated in the Village of Bandarapuliyankulama in the Sub Division of Nuwaragam Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Nuwaragam Palatha Central, in the District of Anuradhapura.",
