      398.01,
      294.85,
      458.04
    ],
    "text": "T. S. P. P. 14B Lot No. : Part of land 2045; Name of the land: Puliyankulama Archaeological Reservation; Extent of Land: 3.6292 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
