      267.68,
      546.8,
      397.95
    ],
    "text": "In addition, all claimants are requested to submit their claims in duplicate on or before 09th day of January 2015 giving information on the nature of the claim, justification for the request, required amount of compensation, method of compensation calculation (how was the amount calculated, with plan number and lot number of the land. G. A. KITHSIRI, Divisional Secretary, Nuwaragam Palatha Central.",
